1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:05,360
Place an order from the chart: point above the market and click the plus.

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:12,990
Pick Sell Limit, then click the tick to send it.

3
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,650
The pending order is drawn on the chart: Sell 0.01.

4
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:18,480
To change it, click the pencil on its label.

5
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:22,870
Click the amount, then use plus or minus.

6
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:27,900
Click the tick. The order is changed to 0.02 on the server.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,260
The Pending tab shows the new amount.

8
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:38,440
The X on the label removes the order. You are asked first.

9
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,440
The order is gone.

